SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers this repository's own material: the build and
packaging scripts, the documentation, and the patch files as authored works.

It does NOT relicense the projects being patched or packaged. When a patch is
applied, the resulting modified files remain under their upstream licenses:

  - rclone ...................... MIT, Copyright (c) Nick Craig-Wood
  - Syncthing ................... MPL-2.0, Copyright (c) The Syncthing Authors
  - GitHub CLI .................. MIT, Copyright (c) GitHub Inc.
  - golang.org/x/sys, Go ........ BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) The Go Authors.
                                  patches/deps/sys.patch carries the Haiku
                                  port of korli/sys_haiku (amd64) and of
                                  renkuos-golang (arm64) and adds 386.
  - the other modules under patches/deps keep their own licenses.

In short: the glue is MIT, the patched code keeps its upstream license.
